Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.41,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}After splitting, list each army's stock and capacity separately.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.67,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}分兵以后，把每队的库存和容量分别列出来。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.41,0:00:07.24,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}Stock is what each army actually carries;
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.67,0:00:07.84,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}库存是各队实际带着多少，容
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.24,0:00:10.00,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}capacity is what that army can currently
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.84,0:00:11.00,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}量是这支军队当前能带多少。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.00,0:00:10.41,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}carry.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.41,0:00:13.58,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}Keep each army's real values in the comparison.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.00,0:00:16.04,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}比较时保留每支军队的真实值，不把两队库存相加，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.58,0:00:17.08,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}Adding the two stocks or taking an average does not
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.04,0:00:20.86,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}或者求个平均，就写成一支并不存在的整军补给。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.08,0:00:20.52,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}produce the supply of an intact army that does not
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.52,0:00:20.93,English,en-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}exist.
